                "last updated": "2001-01-01",
                "license": "(not set)",
                "title": "POKE Mission 97",
                "version": "(not set)",
                "releasenotes": "The first version of POKE Mission was written in 1990-1991 by Anders and Leif Granlund. It was written in STOS-Basic for the Atari ST. A couple of weeks ago I discovered the Dr.Pan of Anthrox document, and became more and more interested in programming on the Gameboy. I have never used assembler before, but thanks to the excellent document I soon learned how to use sprites, background, etc… There has been two official demo-versions (ver0.1 and ver 0.2) released before this FINAL version was completed!",
                "screenshots": [
                    {
